{
  "changelog": "Initial release of api-gateway skill:\n\n- Provides a passthrough API gateway for direct access to third-party APIs with managed OAuth connections via Maton.\n- Supports connections and API calls to numerous external services (e.g., Slack, HubSpot, Salesforce, Google Workspace, Stripe).\n- Offers secure access scoped to explicitly authorized OAuth connections; requires a valid Maton API key.\n- Includes connection management endpoints for listing, creating, viewing, and deleting OAuth connections.\n- Allows users to specify which connection to use via a custom header.\n- Detailed documentation with usage examples and a table of supported services included.",
